  error[munge-name-collision]: sm `hork.tool` munges to the sh function name
  `hork_tool__predict`, shared by 2 distinct source names (hork.tool, hork-tool)
  -- REFUSED, never silently merged (the shipped artifact would carry 2
  same-named funcdefs, last-writer-wins; align with the reingest-collision
  floor: refuse-and-run)
        [ oracle.sh:4:1
     4 | hork.tool__predict() {
       | \________________/
  error[munge-name-collision]: sm `hork-tool` munges to the sh function name
  `hork_tool__predict`, shared by 2 distinct source names (hork.tool, hork-tool)
  -- REFUSED, never silently merged (the shipped artifact would carry 2
  same-named funcdefs, last-writer-wins; align with the reingest-collision
  floor: refuse-and-run)
